decision game-loop-design
  How should movement timing be controlled?

option fixed-timestep
  Move the snake using a fixed simulation interval.

option frame-dependent-movement
  Move the snake according to rendered frame timing.

link fixed-timestep option-of game-loop-design
link frame-dependent-movement option-of game-loop-design

claim fixed-timestep-is-consistent
  Fixed simulation steps produce consistent movement across devices.

link fixed-timestep supports fixed-timestep-is-consistent
link fixed-timestep-is-consistent opposes frame-dependent-movement
